  "id": "claim_d815de1b82bf47ef84063fd75dfc7f9b",
  "statement": "init_chat_model() is a unified factory function that instantiates chat models from any supported provider by provider name (e.g., 'openai:gpt-4o'). It automatically infers providers from model name patterns, dynamically imports provider packages, handles missing dependencies with helpful error messages, and supports both fixed models and configurable runtime models via the configurable_fields parameter.",
