  "statement": "_BUILTIN_PROVIDERS is a dict mapping provider names to (module_path, class_name, creator_func) tuples. It covers 30+ providers including openai, anthropic, bedrock, google_vertexai, groq, ollama, and others. Each entry specifies the module to import, the model class to instantiate, and an optional custom creator function for non-standard initialization.",
