  "id": "claim_98088bfb656441899cb0096c4787d893",
  "statement": "_attempt_infer_model_provider() infers provider from model name patterns: gpt-*|o1|o3->openai, claude*->anthropic, command*->cohere, accounts/fireworks*->fireworks, mistral*|mixtral*->mistralai, deepseek*->deepseek, grok*->xai, sonar*->perplexity, solar*->upstage, gemini*->google_vertexai, amazon.*|anthropic.*|meta.*->bedrock. Inference is best-effort; explicit provider prefix is preferred to avoid ambiguity.",
