  "statement": "_get_chat_model_creator() validates provider is in _BUILTIN_PROVIDERS, imports the module via _import_module(), retrieves the model class, and returns a cached partial function. _import_module() wraps importlib.import_module() to provide helpful pip install suggestions when imports fail.",
