  "statement": "_ConfigurableModel defers model instantiation until invoke time. It queues declarative operations (bind_tools, with_structured_output) and applies them after instantiation. It merges default config with runtime config from config['configurable'] based on config_prefix and configurable_fields constraints. Implements invoke/ainvoke/stream/astream/batch/abatch by calling _model(config) to instantiate the underlying model.",
